@startuml state-machine
!theme materia
title Chat — Machine d'états (FSM)

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #fff
  BorderColor #6B46C1
  FontColor #1F2937
  AttributeFontColor #6B46C1
}

[*] --> Idle : init store rehydrate

state Idle {
  [*] --> Closed
  Closed : panel hidden
  Closed : badge visible (unread?)
}

state Open {
  [*] --> Greeting

  state Greeting {
    Greeting : greeting affiché
    Greeting : 3 pills suggestion visibles
    Greeting : composer focusable
  }

  state UserTyping {
    UserTyping : textarea active
    UserTyping : send enabled si len>0
  }

  state Streaming {
    Streaming : SSE ouverte
    Streaming : assistant placeholder + TypingDots
    Streaming : delta append en temps réel
    Streaming : Composer disabled (send)
  }

  state LocalStreaming {
    LocalStreaming : faux stream canned local
    LocalStreaming : cadence wpm=180 ± jitter
    LocalStreaming : pas d'appel LLM
  }

  state LeadFormShown {
    LeadFormShown : form inline visible
    LeadFormShown : fields (name, phone, city)
    LeadFormShown : submit → POST /api/chat/lead
  }

  state ErrorRecovery {
    ErrorRecovery : message fallback affiché
    ErrorRecovery : retry button OU lead form
    ErrorRecovery : Sentry already notified
  }

  state Resolved {
    Resolved : conversation marquée resolved
    Resolved : feedback thumbs visible
    Resolved : possible new question
  }
}

Closed --> Greeting : openChat()
Greeting --> UserTyping : focus composer
Greeting --> LocalStreaming : pick suggestion
UserTyping --> Streaming : send message
Streaming --> Resolved : event:done
Streaming --> ErrorRecovery : event:error
Streaming --> LeadFormShown : event:lead_form_offered
LocalStreaming --> Resolved : end of text
LocalStreaming --> UserTyping : user starts typing
Resolved --> UserTyping : new input
ErrorRecovery --> UserTyping : retry click
ErrorRecovery --> LeadFormShown : "be called back"
LeadFormShown --> Resolved : submit success
LeadFormShown --> UserTyping : cancel/back

Open --> Closed : closeChat()
Closed --> [*] : page leave (session persists)

state ServiceLevel <<choice>>
Streaming --> ServiceLevel : sl change
ServiceLevel --> ErrorRecovery : sl=3 mid-stream
ServiceLevel --> Resolved : sl back to 0/1

note bottom of LocalStreaming
  Continuité après canned:
  Si user envoie msg suivant,
  orchestrator ajoute note
  système "tours canned sont
  tes réponses, poursuis le ton"
end note

note right of ErrorRecovery
  Provider down OU budget OU sl=3:
  Tous tombent ici.
  UI identique = pas de leak métier.
end note

@enduml
